<title>USA: Affiliated Computer sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Affiliated Computer sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Affiliated Computer Services Inc said on Monday that its board of directors has set a two-for-one stock split in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is payable November 22, 1996 to holders of record November 11.</p>
</text>
